{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"authenticationCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"– a code obtained from the backend Sentiance API."}]}],"name":"authenticationCode"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accepts an authentication code, which will be used to create a linked Sentiance user."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The supplied authentication code is used to find the app user to link to during the user creation process. Therefore,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before calling this method, make sure that you have obtained a valid code from the backend Sentiance API. This code"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request is authenticated using a Sentiance API key, which must never be transmitted to the app. Hence why the request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must come from your backend."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the complete steps:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initiate an authentication code request via your backend towards the Sentiance backend. This request will include"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your app’s user identifier, which will be temporarily coupled to the code that you will receive."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieve the code in your app and supply it to this initializer."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build and pass a SENTUserCreationOptions object containing this code to createUserWithOptions:completionHandler:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to create a linked user. If the authentication code references an app user that exists on the Sentiance Platform","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(i.e. an app user identifier that was previously supplied to Sentiance), its corresponding Sentiance user will be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restored on this device. Any other SDK instance with this user will then get disabled."}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentusercreationoptions\/init(authenticationcode:)"]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/sentsdk\/sentusercreationoptions\/init(authenticationcode:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"init(authenticationCode:)","symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"authenticationCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserCreationOptions(im)initWithAuthenticationCode:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithAuthenticationCode:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK","doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserCreationOptions"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserCreationOptions\/init(authenticationCode:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://com.sentiance.SENTSD